class CellMerge {
  definition {
Specification of merging two adjacent cells of a table: the cell at
`from` absorbs the grid slots of the cell at `to`. The cells shall be
adjacent on the same grid row (a horizontal merge, increasing the
column span) or in the same grid column (a vertical merge, increasing
the row span). The content of both cells is concatenated, in document
order, into the merged cell.
  }
  +from: CellCoordinate {
    definition {
The cell that absorbs the slots of the other cell.
    }
  }
  +to: CellCoordinate {
    definition {
The cell whose slots are absorbed; it ceases to exist.
    }
  }
}
